  {
    "insert": "Strength:",
    "attributes": {
      "bold": true
    }
  },
  {
    "insert": "\nA well-structured exposé is essential for ensuring clarity and readability. A consistent structure helps guide the reader smoothly through the content, making complex ideas easier to follow and understand. This exposé has a very good structure."
  },
  {
    "insert": "\n",
    "attributes": {
